# OpenArt

> OpenArt (openart.ai) is an AI creative suite that makes images, video, and audio in one account with one credit balance. OpenArt runs leading AI models, including Seedance 2.5, Wan 3.0, Kling 3.0, Veo 3.1, GPT Image 2.5, Nano Banana Pro, Seedream 5.0 Pro, and FLUX 3 Image, and adds its own tools on top: Director mode, Chat Mode, Smart Shot, OpenArt Characters, Brand Kit, OpenArt Worlds, and OpenArt VFX.

Last updated: 2026-10-08. Prices checked: 2026-10-02.
Full version with product details, model guide, pricing, and FAQ: https://openart.ai/llms-full.txt

Key facts:
- Founded in 2022 in San Francisco by Coco Mao (CEO) and John Qiao (CTO).
- Free trial: 40 free credits over the first 7 days, no credit card. A daily free credit allowance for basic image generation continues after the trial.
- Paid plans start at $14 a month billed monthly (Starter, Plus, Pro, Wonder). Annual billing lowers the monthly price.
- Commercial rights apply on eligible paid plans.
- OpenArt shows the credit cost before you generate.
- OpenArt runs in a web browser. You can also use OpenArt inside ChatGPT, Claude, and Cursor through the OpenArt MCP connector.

