## AI models (video)

- [Seedance 2.5](https://openart.ai/ai-model/seedance-2-5/): OpenArt's flagship video model; clips up to 30 seconds with synced audio and a large reference budget.
- [Wan 3.0](https://openart.ai/ai-model/wan-3/): 30-second clips in one pass with native audio and multi-shot shot lists.
- [Kling 3.0 and Kling 3 Omni](https://openart.ai/ai-model/kling-ai-video-generator/): 720p to 4K, synced audio, native multi-shot.
- [Kling 3.0 Motion Control](https://openart.ai/ai-model/kling-3-motion-control/): Motion-controlled Kling video.
- [Veo 3.1](https://openart.ai/ai-model/veo3-video-generator/): Google's high-fidelity video with native audio, up to 4K.
- [MiniMax H3 (Hailuo 3.0)](https://openart.ai/ai-model/minimax-h3/): Native 2K with strong physical realism in motion.
- [Gemini Omni Flash](https://openart.ai/ai-model/gemini-omni-flash/): Cinematic video with synced dialogue, sound effects, and music.
- [Seedance 2.0](https://openart.ai/ai-model/seedance-2-0/): Realistic people and animals with single-pass synced audio.
- [Wan 2.7](https://openart.ai/ai-model/wan-2-7-ai-video-generator/): Lower-cost cinematic short clips with start and end frame.
- [PixVerse V6](https://openart.ai/ai-model/pixverse-video-generator/): Stable camera motion and strong 3D-anime motion.
- [Grok Imagine](https://openart.ai/ai-model/grok-imagine/): xAI's fast 1080p video with synced audio, plus image editing.
- [LTX 2.3](https://openart.ai/ai-model/ltx-2-3-ai-video-generator/): Lightricks video generation.

